# Third-party notices

Coco MCP is Copyright (c) 2026 Camilo Azula, licensed under either the MIT
license (`LICENSE-MIT`) or the Apache License, Version 2.0 (`LICENSE-APACHE`),
at your option. The `coco-mcp` binary is built from the open-source crates
below, each under the licence expression beside it, and embeds two fonts.
Their notices follow, one heading per licence. A crate offered a choice of
licences is taken under Apache-2.0 when it offers it, whose text is printed
once; under every other licence each distinct notice is printed once, with
the crates it covers, so each copyright line travels with the binary. A crate
that ships no notice of its own is listed with its licence's canonical text.

Generated from `Cargo.lock` by `just notices` for the targets the release
builds; do not edit by hand. Inputs digest `@INPUTS_DIGEST@` (what
`just notices-check` compares).

